### Apache License 2.0
以下组件使用 Apache-2.0 协议：
- **opencv-python** (>=4.8.0) — Apache-2.0 (核心), LGPL-2.1 (FFmpeg 捆绑) — https://github.com/opencv/opencv-python/blob/master/LICENSE.txt
- **huggingface_hub** (>=0.20.0) — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/huggingface/huggingface_hub/blob/main/LICENSE

